    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设整个矩形底边DC长为L，高FE=400。DE=AF=600；O在对角线DB上，△DEO与△DCB相似，得到OE/400=600/L。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "阴影△COD以DC为底，高OE，所以面积为L×（400×600/L）÷2，L正好约掉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "S_{COD}=\\frac12 L\\times\\frac{400\\times600}{L}=120000\\text{平方米}=12\\text{万平方米}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "结果120000平方米，即12万平方米，我们选A。右侧休闲区的宽度不需要知道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
