        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看同一直线上的底边：BD：DE：EC=1：2：3，所以DE占BC的2/6=1/3。△ADE与△ABC共高，面积比也是1/3。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "F是AE中点，到BC的高只有A的一半，所以△DEF面积又是△ADE的一半，等于△ABC的1/6。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\frac{S_{DEF}}{S_{ABC}}=\\frac{DE}{BC}\\times\\frac{h_F}{h_A}=\\frac26\\times\\frac12=\\frac16"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "总园区面积是中央工厂区的6倍，我们选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
