    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25浙江）一块四边形田地ABCD如下图所示，已知△AOD、△AOB和△COD的面积分别为9平方千米、15平方千米和12平方千米，CD长8千米。问B点到CD的距离为多少千米？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "6"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "7"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "8"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "9"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C",
        "stemBlocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "（25浙江）一块四边形田地ABCD如下图所示，已知△AOD、△AOB和△COD的面积分别为9平方千米、15平方千米和12平方千米，CD长8千米。问B点到CD的距离为多少千米？"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-03-figure-01.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（二）原题示意图，讲义第154页",
            "caption": "讲义原图 · 点击放大"
          }
        ]
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          160
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          154
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-03-p160.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（二） · 实战精刷3 · 讲义第154页",
            "pdfPage": 160
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先用两条对角线形成的对顶面积关系：S_AOD×S_BOC=S_AOB×S_COD，所以S_BOC=15×12÷9=20。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "△BCD由△BOC与△COD组成，总面积20+12=32平方千米。以CD=8千米为底，B点到CD的距离就是其高。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "S_{BOC}=\\frac{15\\times12}{9}=20,\\quad h_{B\\to CD}=\\frac{2(20+12)}8=8"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "高为2×32÷8=8千米，我们选C。这里CD不是图中水平的BC，读字母时不要看成相邻边。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
