    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-04-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-04",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设上底AB=a、下底CD=2a、梯形高h，总面积为3ah/2。先算上面两块白色△AEF与△FBG，再从整体扣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "F是AB中点，AF=FB=a/2；E、G是两腰中点，到AB的距离都是h/2，因此每块白色面积ah/8，两块合计ah/4，占梯形的1/6。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\frac{S_{\\text{白}}}{S_{\\text{梯}}}=\\frac{2\\times\\frac12\\times(a/2)\\times(h/2)}{3ah/2}=\\frac16,\\quad S_{\\text{阴影}}=120\\times\\frac56=100"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "阴影占5/6，120×5/6=100亩，我们选D。这里用中点关系即可，不必求60°或梯形具体高。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
